{"version":1,"content":"<p>無綫電視（TVB）昨日（19日）舉行年度盛事《萬千星輝賀台慶》，一眾女星悉心打扮踏上紅地氈，但卻不及地位超然的汪明荃（阿姐）搶鏡。</p><p>汪明荃以一身視覺衝擊力的全紅造型造亮相，一舉手一投足散發出個人魅力，震驚全場。</p><p>&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T08:24:03.301698+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":113,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T08:08:11+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T08:17:15.596533+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-20T08:17:15.596533+00:00","content_hash":"9a2e55e0ec1d9501c2b2dc0304c5e5d92a95c46787fb346b9434fb2cf70d3929","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}